# Screenshot PII audit

When adding or updating files under `assets/img/`:

1. Take screenshots from [dashboard-06](https://dashboard-06.braze.com/) (FakeBrandz) — never production customer data.
2. Blur or replace **external_id** values, preview-row user data, customer-specific attribute names, and production CSV filenames.
3. Before opening a PR, run:

   ```bash
   python3 scripts/check_screenshot_pii.py path/to/your-image.png
   ```

4. CI **Check screenshot PII** is **blocking** on image changes.

False positives: add `your-image.png.pii-audit-dismiss.json` with a documented `reason`, or ask a maintainer to add the `pii-audit-dismissed` label after review.

See `@screenshot-pii-audit` and [image style guide](docs/contributing/style_guide/image_style_guide.md).
